    "title": "Clipboard Health",
    "description": "Start Working Now: Apply on our secure platform, and after you finish onboarding, you can pick up shifts immediately!\r\n\r\nGet Paid Quickly with InstantPay: Want to get paid right after you complete a shift? With InstantPay, you'll have money in your account faster than at traditional jobs!\r\n\r\nMake Your Own Schedule: You get to decide when you want to work, and how much or little you want to work \u2014 that equals better work-life balance for you.\r\n\r\nBook Your Preferred Shifts: We offer AM, PM, NOC, and custom shift schedules, so you can book the shifts you want. \r\n\r\nChoose Where You Want to Work: You'll even get to choose your favorite facilites \u2014 and we're always adding new facility partners in your area!\r\n\r\nEnjoy Total Control Over Your Work Schedule and Get Paid ASAP! Pick up shifts when you want to at your favorite facilities. You worked hard to become a health care professional, now get the work-life balance and quick paychecks you deserve!",
